==Notes==
* All [[class]]es except [[assassin]]s, [[Harper scout]]s, [[monk]]s, [[pale master]]s, [[purple dragon knight]]s, [[red dragon disciple]]s, [[rogue]]s, [[shadowdancer]]s, [[shifter]]s, [[sorcerer]]s, [[weapon master]]s and [[wizard]]s receive this feat for free.

==Builder notes==
'''Item feat:''' yes

*Adding this feat to [[armor]] is pointless; it will not have an effect. Heavy and medium armor with this feat can only be equipped by a character who already has this feat. Light armor with this feat cannot be equipped simultaneously with medium armor.
*Armor with base [[armor class|AC]] from 4 to 5 counts as medium armor and requires this feat to equip.

==Custom content notes==
'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes

'''Script:''' [[hardcoded]]

*Removing this feat from the game will not remove the requirement for equipping medium armor.